WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.166
Revise the reusable instructions to require a conflict check and a human clarification route.

00:00:06.166 --> 00:00:10.130
Retest the same conflicting input against the same expectation.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:15.415
Preserve the actual revised output, then check the normal path still works.

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:18.938
Claim only the improvement supported by that evidence.
